WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:06.850
<i>If I am to devote my life to someone,
I will surpass my limitation.</i>

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:12.340
<i>Now and here,
I will become my own strength.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.490
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:25.600
<i>There are places I like to forget.
There are memories I like to forget.</i>

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.950
<i>I can't get rid of this swirling hesitation...
and my pride is wounded.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.080
<i>The light is covered in dust,
if you see through the darkness...</i>

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.500
<i>You can find your path to the new door.</i>

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:50.730
<i>Beautiful sword dances like the wind.</i>

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:57.650
<i>Fate so strong, it creates miracles in my life.</i>

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:00.220
<i>Flower of Bravery.</i>

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:07.100
<i>Looking only for the truth.
I noticed you were there beside me.</i>

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:12.820
<i>Your special soul will be our bond.</i>

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>A sadness I can't break free reflects in the depths of my memory.</i>

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Now and here, my sadness will be my strength.</i>

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.520
<i>And I will march toward the future.</i>

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:10.390
Sui, you are hiding something, aren't you?

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.800
What are you talking about?  I didn't wet my bed this morning...

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:19.330
I see.   That's what you've been hiding.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:24.300
But, how did you know?  I was hiding something.

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:27.040
Martial art is about harmony.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:32.240
If there is guilt in your heart,
it will be manifest in your soul.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.490
Then...

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:40.190
I saw the lack of harmony from your mind, reflected in your posture.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.710
You don't have to be ashamed of wetting your bed.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.160
That's not it...

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.730
You could read my feelings just by looking at me...

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:56.670
I can't... and it frustrates me.

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.890
Oh, I see.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:04.420
Don't worry, if you seriously keep training, you will be able to detect the soul.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:05.380
Really!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.640
Yes, really.

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:13.390
<b>Bachō Attacks Sōsō</b>

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.880
Father, I will practice really hard…

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.460
Practice…

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.530
I was dreaming…

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.280
You finally woke up.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.160
Why are you sleeping on the floor?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.010
I didn’t because I wanted to…

00:03:34.970 --> 00:03:37.460
I was kicked off while I was sleeping.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:41.430
Oh, I am so sorry.  I toss and turn a lot.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:47.420
No need for apology…  While you were sleeping, I had…

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.450
No, since you seem to be a virgin...

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.700
I should better keep it to myself.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:04:00.530
Hey, did you do something to me while I was asleep?!

00:04:05.830 --> 00:04:10.330
Thank you so much for sharing your room and your food.

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:14.200
Don’t mention it.  Journeys are more fun with friends, times are best…

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.880
Times are disappointing…

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.900
It’s “times are best if you have sympathy for others”.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:25.090
It is uncomfortable to sleep with four people in a small room.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.470
We should have taken our prize money.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:30.090
That’s right.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.300
But getting it after all that is…

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.810
Do you guys know the tale?

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:41.350
Long ago, King Kousen, King of Etsu...

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:47.840
He hung rotting guts from his bed chamber ceiling…

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.510
And licked it, so he won’t forget his revenge against his enemies during  his captivity.

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:57.670
Really?  And what does this have to do with our talk?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.180
Nothing in particular.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.620
Lord Karin.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:21.600
What was the outcome of the battle?

00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.580
Our troops overwhelmed them.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:28.390
There was no need for me to make an appearance.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.430
You are all sweaty.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.850
I will wipe it off immediately.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:39.080
Please do, but not with a towel.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.430
Use your tongue, Keifa.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:45.040
Lord Karin…  But…

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:46.260
What is the matter?

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:49.340
Are you refusing my order?

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.850
Well then…

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:16.030
Umm, that’s good.

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.110
Yes, just like that.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.480
You are improving at this.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.600
Lord Karin.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.140
Continue, Keifa.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.560
Yes, my lord.

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:39.830
Shunran, you have something to report?

00:06:40.190 --> 00:06:44.790
Yes… The enemy’s main forces have mostly been destroyed.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:49.060
Their leader has been captured and
Kakou En is dealing with the remaining cells.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:52.940
I see.  Good work.  You may leave now.

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:55.150
Yes.

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:09.290
What is it Shunran, why the solemn face?

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.110
I don’t particularly have a solemn face.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:17.230
Don’t be upset, I will call you to my chamber instead of Keifa tonight.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:21.470
Please don’t tease me.  I am not like…

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:25.840
What’s with you Shuuran?  Why are you smirking?

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:31.270
It’s nice that the transporting job paid more than we expected.

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:35.440
After all I worked very hard.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:39.410
That’s not fair.  I worked very hard too.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:42.730
What’s going on?

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.250
It’s Sōsō!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.520
What?  Sōsō?

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:55.400
Hi!

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:57.130
You are the kid from the other day…

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.700
Is the black hair lady with you today?

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:02.890
Aisha is working right now.

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:06.200
I see.  So her name is Aisha.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.470
Her friends call her Aisha, but she’s known as Kan'u to everyone else.

00:08:12.320 --> 00:08:13.410
Sōsō!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.130
Meet your end!

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:19.310
Who are you?

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.710
The daughter of the late Batō, Bachō!

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.470
I will have my revenge for my father’s death.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.300
Stop it!  No fighting!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.450
Let go of me!  Get out of my way!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.910
What are we doing standing around?  Capture her!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:45.310
Yes!

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:46.880
I said let go!

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.500
No!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.620
Welcome back, my maste…

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.580
My name is Kakou En.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:09.030
I am looking for someone by the name of Kan'u.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:15.750
These guys are evil!  They captured Bachō, because she tried to kill Sōsō.

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:22.430
By your explanation, I don’t find them evil!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:26.510
I see.  So that’s what took place?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.270
I understand, Bachō is my adopted sister’s friend.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:33.390
We can’t just leave it at that.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:36.670
I would like to ask for permission to see her.

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:40.380
I will go to Lord Sōsō’s prison to visit Bachō.

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.560
You go back to the inn and stay with Sei.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:44.580
Why?

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:47.660
I am going with you to get Bachō back.

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:52.060
You are too impatient and might do more damage than good.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.780
Leave this to Aisha.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:55.270
But!

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:57.560
Rin Rin, trust me, please.

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:01.560
I will bring Bachō back for sure.  All right?

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:13.810
Bachō.

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.340
Kan'u…

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.390
I heard what happened.

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:21.860
How stupid of me, I was full of rage.  I messed up really bad.

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:26.160
I never thought I’d see her in a place like that.

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:29.010
Chōhi even tried to stop me.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:35.400
Why did you want to kill Lord Sōsō?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.000
Sōsō killed my father…

00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:42.550
She killed my father!

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.520
And in the dirtiest way possible!

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:57.150
Lord Karin, Kan'u is here to see you.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.700
Let her in.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.140
Lord Sōsō.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:11.350
I was not expecting to see you again, especially here.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:15.550
I will get straight to the point, what are you planning to do with Bachō?

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.010
I plan to execute her!

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.730
No way.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:22.830
For whatever reason, she tried to kill me.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.190
Her action requires relevant punishment.

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:27.200
I understand...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:29.820
She tried to take the life of a general of the government army.

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:32.630
I can’t just let her go without any consequence.

00:11:33.060 --> 00:11:34.630
That’s true, but…

00:11:37.070 --> 00:11:42.300
Lord Sōsō, is there any way you can spare her life?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.520
Kan'u, if you really want to save her that bad…

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.580
Why don’t we make a deal?

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:51.930
A deal?

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:55.870
You spend the night with me.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:12:00.840
And I’ll spare her life.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.060
That’s a silly deal.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:09.510
From the moment I saw you, I wanted to possess your beautiful black hair.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:16.200
And I always get what I want, no matter the price.

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:20.370
How can you be so nonchalant when someone’s life is at stake?

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:25.240
You can save her life with just a nod.

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:46.060
Will you really spare Bachō’s life, if I spend the night with you?

00:12:46.560 --> 00:12:48.970
Yes, I promise.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:12.670
Sōsō... Is this really going to save her life?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:16.280
I did say I keep my promise.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.050
Could this be your first time?

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.700
This makes me yearn for you even more.

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.560
Ah, I can feel your passion.

00:13:48.440 --> 00:13:50.070
You don’t need to be afraid.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.180
Intruder!  Sound the alarm!

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:07.840
Lord Karin!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:11.560
Lord Karin!

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:14.310
I am fine!  Chase after the intruder instead.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:15.340
Yes ma’am!

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:25.740
Lord Karin.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:26.970
Did you capture the intruder?

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.620
I am sorry.

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.440
When we caught up with her, she’d already…

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:31.590
I see.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.280
Lord Sōsō.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.490
Do you know who sent the assassin?

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:41.890
The nail that sticks out gets hammered.
There are many in the capital who would like to see me dead.

00:14:42.390 --> 00:14:47.390
However, I didn’t think they’d send an assassin this far.  That was careless of me.

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.930
The assassin ruined my mood.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:54.340
I am going to sleep now.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.290
Lord Sōsō?

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:57.250
Kan'u.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:01.790
I am thankful to you for saving my life.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:05.430
As a reward, I will spare Bachō’s life.

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:06.490
Thank you, Lord Sōsō.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.280
But...

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:11.290
It doesn’t mean I’ve given up on you.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:15.260
I will someday stroke your beautiful black hair.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:18.470
So look forward to the day it happens.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:21.710
Shunran, turn Bachō over to her.

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.470
Yes my lord.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:30.420
Kakou Ton, I'd like to ask you a question.

00:15:30.850 --> 00:15:33.760
I will answer to the best of my ability.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:39.160
Is it true that Sōsō killed Bachō’s father?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.620
Kan'u, I am recalling the incident out loud.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.320
It was a few years ago...

00:15:51.740 --> 00:15:56.370
When Lord Karin was invited to the Great General Kashin’s palace in the capital.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.520
<i>Sōsō.</i>

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:05.480
<i>Yes?</i>

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:09.480
<i>I always thought of you as a tactician...</i>

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:12.660
<i>But I hear you’re a master swordsman as well.</i>

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.750
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:16:13.920 --> 00:16:18.920
<i>Could you have a match with one of the guests and show me your skills?</i>

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.300
<i>If that’s what you wish.</i>

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.960
<i>How about you Batō?</i>

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:35.900
<i>If you wish.</i>

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.090
<i>Please wait.</i>

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:43.610
<i>You seem to be quite intoxicated.</i>

00:16:43.910 --> 00:16:46.240
<i>Even for entertainment purposes, it’s not safe to wield your sword.…</i>

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:49.640
<i>I haven’t begun drinking yet.</i>

00:16:55.100 --> 00:17:00.460
<i>I guess Sōsō is right, you are a bit drunk.</i>

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.190
<i>You shouldn’t push yourself.</i>

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:09.670
Maybe out of his embarrassment for losing face, he drank even more.

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:17.120
After the end of the feast, he went home alone. On his way…

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:22.180
My unit was on patrol that night, when we found him.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:25.090
It seemed he hit his head fairly hard falling off his horse.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.810
He was dying.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:32.240
<i>It is a disgrace to my martial art clan that I died falling off my horse drunk.</i>

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:35.060
<i>I want this to be kept a secret…</i>

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:40.220
I made sure my soldiers kept their mouths shut.

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:45.550
Someone must have seen what happened.  A strange rumor spread shortly after the incident.

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:47.540
A strange rumor?

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:54.850
That my mistress ordered the attack against Batō as payback for humiliating her.

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.240
Why would anyone do that?

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:01.940
My master tends to be misunderstood by others.

00:18:02.200 --> 00:18:06.710
So, when incidents like this happen, rumors start flying.

00:18:07.470 --> 00:18:10.410
Bachō probably took the rumors as truth.

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:13.960
Why doesn’t she reveal the truth?

00:18:14.050 --> 00:18:17.600
I suggested the idea to her a few times but my master said…

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:26.790
“We can’t deny the famous warrior Batō of Seiryou’s dying wish”.

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:34.730
Besides, she didn’t want to crush a child's pride in her father’s legacy, by way of his death.

00:18:35.570 --> 00:18:40.570
Well, that’s just my theory.

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:43.090
So then, Lord Sōsō is…

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:46.300
This is just the kind of person she is.

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:50.700
Kakou Ton.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:57.920
Can you recall the incident once more out loud in front of Bachō?

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:00.760
No way!

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.050
My father was…

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:07.750
My father died falling off a horse drunk…

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:14.960
Bachō, Lord Sōsō kept this secret, because of you and your father.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:19.200
By respecting Batō’s dying wish...

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:26.410
She sullied her reputation, which was a selfless act.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:31.810
I thought you needed to know this...

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:35.890
So you will not hold a grudge based on a rumor.

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:39.600
That’s a lie.  Why should I believe Sōsō’s subordinate?

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:43.830
Are you calling me a liar?

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:47.670
Kakou Ton, Bachō is just confused at the moment…

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:50.950
Bachō, I understand you are overwhelmed with emotion, but calm down…

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:51.840
Don’t touch me!

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.020
I can’t believe you were coaxed by Sōsō.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:59.060
What did she promise you, a commanding position in her army?

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.500
Bachō, pick up your weapon and stand up!

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:03.700
Kakou Ton!

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:08.660
I am a warrior; I will not take kindly to being called a liar.

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:13.360
As you wish!  I will rip your head off as a starter for my revenge!

00:20:18.330 --> 00:20:19.390
You two, stop this nonsense!

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.960
What will come out of this useless fight?

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:26.800
Kan'u, do not interfere.  There are plenty of idiots in this world, who only understand death.

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:27.800
Shut up!

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:48.550
<i>What’s with her?</i>

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.590
<i>There are no weak points.</i>

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:57.950
<i>Her posture is like a tree in a deep forest.</i>

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:03.080
<i>Her aura is like flowing water.</i>

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.190
<i>Martial art is about harmony.</i>

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:12.320
<i>If there is guilt in your heart,
it will be manifest in your soul.</i>

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:17.680
Then, that means…

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:24.600
What she said was the truth and…  Father was…

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.740
She felt the harmony between your body and soul...

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:41.520
And she realized you were not lying.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.660
Right, Bachō?

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.840
I guess we say our goodbyes here.

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:11.480
That’s too bad, we just became friends.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:13.830
Are you still going back home?

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:18.790
Yeah, I need to tell the truth about my father to my people.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.010
Yes, that’s for the best.

00:22:21.480 --> 00:22:24.880
Kan'u, I am very much indebted to you.

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:26.540
Nah, don’t worry about it.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:28.460
And also…

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:36.930
Please keep my crying a secret?  Especially, from Chōhi.

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:42.890
Bye!

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:46.070
See you!  Later!

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:48.620
Bye-bye!

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:53.260
You seem very happy to say goodbye to your friend.

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:58.490
When people part the last thing they remember is each other’s face, until they meet again.

00:22:58.850 --> 00:23:03.220
I want Bachō to remember my happy face.

00:23:03.720 --> 00:23:04.680
I see.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:29.240
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:34.210
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:23:35.660 --> 00:23:39.870
<i>Anywhere I am, it always turns into paradise.</i>

00:23:40.790 --> 00:23:44.630
<i>Every season, mellow and carefree.
Today and tomorrow, always an adventure.</i>

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:49.700
<i>I run away when times are tough.
But get involved when easy and fun.</i>

00:23:49.800 --> 00:23:54.960
<i>If I stress, I just stop and smell the roses.  If there's a great opportunity, I go for it!</i>

00:23:54.990 --> 00:24:00.030
<i>There are so many things that I want.</i>

00:24:00.030 --> 00:24:06.910
<i>I am so brave, that I can take on the invincible.</i>

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:12.840
<i>After all said and done, I am the heroine of this world.</i>

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:17.900
<i>The world revolves around me.  I am the center of the world!</i>

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:23.130
<i>I am the heroine of this world, no matter what.</i>

00:24:23.130 --> 00:24:28.300
<i>Such a splendid world,
no questions asked, because I said so.</i>

00:24:37.830 --> 00:24:44.880
<b>Cutie-cute</b>
